  "$comment": "Meridian category tree — the ONE file to edit to add/rename/reorder categories (see docs/CATEGORIES.md). Two levels: groups -> categories. Group options: `featured: true` pins the group's card(s) above the tabs; `layout: \"list\"` shows wide cards instead of a compact grid. Category `type` here is only the SEED default used the first time the backend sees a category; after that the backend database is authoritative (admin panel / SQL) and the browser's copy is never trusted. `flagNumber` is never written here: it is derived from the dataset. `flagSource`: {kind:'bundled', where?} filters the flags shipped in src/data/countries.json; {kind:'remote', dataset} serves server/data/<dataset>.json from the backend (required for paid categories).",
